NAME
    gcloud beta backup-dr - manage Backup and DR resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta backup-dr GROUP [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) Manage Backup and DR resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

GROUPS
    GROUP is one of the following:

     backup-plan-associations
        (BETA) Manage Backup and DR backup plan associations.

     backup-plan-revisions
        (BETA) View Backup and DR backup plan revisions.

     backup-plans
        (BETA) Manage Backup and DR backup plans.

     backup-vaults
        (BETA) Manage Backup and DR backup vaults.

     backups
        (BETA) Manage Backup and DR backups.

     data-source-references
        (BETA) Command group for Backup and DR Data Source References.

     data-sources
        (BETA) View Backup and DR data sources.

     locations
        (BETA) Manage Backup and DR locations.

     management-servers
        (BETA) Manage Backup and DR management server.

     operations
        (BETA) Manage Backup and DR operations.

     resource-backup-config
        (BETA) Show protection summary for resources in a particular location
        and project.

     service-config
        (BETA) Manage Backup and DR Service configuration.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice. These
    variants are also available:

        $ gcloud backup-dr

        $ gcloud alpha backup-dr

